Short:        ARexx script and Instructions on how to use Amiga AutoDocs with SAS/C 6.56 SE
Author:       Manolis S Pappas (mpappas@ba.aegena.gr)
Uploader:     Manolis S Pappas (el93637 central ntua gr)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

	This archive contains instructions and an ARexx script that let's SAS/C's SE editor, look for
Amiga autodocs files that are in AmigaGuide format. Instructions how to convert the autodocs to AmigaGuide
are included. The supplied ARexx macro finds the Amiga or SAS/C library function that is under the SE cursor.

